      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FAKE FRIENDS (7) was at the tail of the field in the Breeders Challenge final but was good in earlier rounds of that series, coming from this barrier to win a heat at this circuit and distance. Worth another chance. ROCKNROLL WILLOW (2) resumes from a spell of 12 weeks after closing off last campaign with three wins, the latest in the Tasmanian Oaks at Hobart as the hot favourite. Readied with two trial wins and a nice draw on the front line should ensure a soft trip in the running. Can pick up where she left off. AGATHA BLOOM (3) drew wide when tackling older rivals last time. Better drawn and had won two of her previous three starts. Nicely placed against the fillies. THE ATTRACTOR (1) draws well and is worth including off a last-start second at Wagga.",
